<title>EGYPT: Egypt forces plane to land between Zaire and Israel.</title>
<headline>Egypt forces plane to land between Zaire and Israel.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1996-11-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>A Russian Ilyushin-76 plane on hire to the government of Zaire entered Egyptian airspace without permission on Sunday and the Egyptian authorities forced it to land at Cairo airport, airport sources said.</p>
<p>The plane, which is fitted to carry passengers, was en route from Zaire to Ben Gurion airport in Israel with a crew of 10 and no passengers aboard, they said.</p>
<p>The plane is expected to resume its journey after paying a fine for breaking civil aviation regulations, they added.</p>
